creatures:
- name: Doppelganger
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 14  
      **Hit Points** 52 (rollable(dice=8d8 + 16,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Initiative) (14)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Deception rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Deception Check), Insight rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Insight Check)  
      **Condition Immunities** charmed  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 11  
      **Languages** Common plus three other languages  
      **Challenge** 3 (700 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The doppelganger makes two Slam attacks and uses Unsettling Visage if available.

      ***Slam.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Slam]) (with ***Advantage*** during the first round of each combat), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6+4,dicelabel=Damage [Slam]) Bludgeoning damage.

      ***Unsettling Visage (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 6,dicelabel=Recharge [Unsettling Visage])).*** *Wisdom Saving Throw:* DC 12, each creature in a 15-foot ***Emanation*** originating from the doppelganger that can see the doppelganger. *Failure:* The target has the ***Frightened*** condition and repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically.

      ***Read Thoughts.*** The doppelganger casts [Detect Thoughts](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619099-detect-thoughts), requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 12).

      At will: [Detect Thoughts](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619099-detect-thoughts)  

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Shape-Shift.*** The doppelganger shape-shifts into a Medium or Small Humanoid, or it returns to its true form. Its game statistics, other than its size, are the same in each form. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn't transformed.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Medium Monstrosity, Neutral*  
    **Challenge** 3
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024doppelganger
  status: 1

